        <headline>Dense Fog Advisory issued September 26 at 4:56AM CDT until September 26 at 11:00AM CDT by NWS Duluth MN</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Visibility less than a quarter mile in dense fog.

* WHERE...Carlton and South St. Louis County.

* WHEN...Until 11 AM CDT this morning.

* IMPACTS...Low visibility could make driving conditions hazardous.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...The dense fog is ongoing for areas in the Twin
Ports on top of the Hill and other areas further inland.
</description>
        <instruction>If driving, slow down, use your low-beam headlights and fog lights,
and leave plenty of distance ahead of you.</instruction>
